    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/c96b31a440b1e50830cd49813a98c066.poster.avif?t=1621263777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/c96b31a440b1e50830cd49813a98c066.webm?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/c96b31a440b1e50830cd49813a98c066.mp4?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Welcome to the darkest nightmare. Prepare to challenge a goddess!<br><br><i>NYX: The Awakening</i> is a blast of 80\u2019s retro nostalgia. Discover the decade that defined modern pop-culture. It doesn\u2019t matter if you\u2019re a nerd or a jock\u2014this game is an experience to remember!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3581b93f051a8213d9c6786ade1d027b.webp?t=1621263777\" /></div><br><br>Vicky was an ordinary teenager living in a typical American town\u2014Mystic, CT. <br>There was nothing unusual about her until the day she came to face the trial of NYX, the ancient deity of the night who turned her life into a living nightmare.<br><br>Help Vicky overcome dangerous traps and stand against nightmarish enemies. Hidden behind this shady fa\u00e7ade, the truth about her life waits to be discovered.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3c5c173db87fec363b63350fbbfa606b.poster.avif?t=1621263777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3c5c173db87fec363b63350fbbfa606b.webm?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3c5c173db87fec363b63350fbbfa606b.mp4?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/0596aab7455dca05cb61751e583f108d.webp?t=1621263777\" /></div>Experience unique gameplay based on a color swapping mechanic<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/b95fb5a3c5c92a415429c6bd0f702707.webp?t=1621263777\" /></div>Face nightmarish creatures from another dimension and enjoy epic combat action<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/0596aab7455dca05cb61751e583f108d.webp?t=1621263777\" /></div>Solve challenging platform and environmental puzzles<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/b95fb5a3c5c92a415429c6bd0f702707.webp?t=1621263777\" /></div>Immerse yourself in synth-wave music and neon-retro visuals, resembling a modern interpretation of classic Sci-Fi and Fantasy media from the 80's",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/c96b31a440b1e50830cd49813a98c066.poster.avif?t=1621263777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/c96b31a440b1e50830cd49813a98c066.webm?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/c96b31a440b1e50830cd49813a98c066.mp4?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Welcome to the darkest nightmare. Prepare to challenge a goddess!<br><br><i>NYX: The Awakening</i> is a blast of 80\u2019s retro nostalgia. Discover the decade that defined modern pop-culture. It doesn\u2019t matter if you\u2019re a nerd or a jock\u2014this game is an experience to remember!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3581b93f051a8213d9c6786ade1d027b.webp?t=1621263777\" /></div><br><br>Vicky was an ordinary teenager living in a typical American town\u2014Mystic, CT. <br>There was nothing unusual about her until the day she came to face the trial of NYX, the ancient deity of the night who turned her life into a living nightmare.<br><br>Help Vicky overcome dangerous traps and stand against nightmarish enemies. Hidden behind this shady fa\u00e7ade, the truth about her life waits to be discovered.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3c5c173db87fec363b63350fbbfa606b.poster.avif?t=1621263777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1139910/extras/3c5c173db87fec363b63350fbbfa606b.webm?t=1621263777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama